    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-34-18", "psalm-34-18", "The LORD is near", "Psalm 34:18", "The LORD is near to those who have a broken heart, and saves those who have a crushed spirit.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-55-22", "psalm-55-22", "He will sustain you", "Psalm 55:22", "Cast your burden on the LORD and he will sustain you. He will never allow the righteous to be moved.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-romans-8-38-39", "romans-8-38-39", "God’s love", "Romans 8:38-39", "For I am persuaded that neither death, nor life, nor angels, nor principalities, nor things present, nor things to come, nor powers, nor height, nor depth, nor any other created thing will be able to separate us from God’s love which is in Christ Jesus our Lord.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-revelation-21-4", "revelation-21-4", "He will wipe away every tear", "Revelation 21:4", "He will wipe away every tear from their eyes. Death will be no more; neither will there be mourning, nor crying, nor pain any more. The first things have passed away.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-23-1", "psalm-23-1", "The LORD is my shepherd", "Psalm 23:1", "The LORD is my shepherd; I shall lack nothing.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-23-4", "psalm-23-4", "You are with me", "Psalm 23:4", "Even though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil, for you are with me. Your rod and your staff, they comfort me.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-hebrews-4-16", "hebrews-4-16", "Grace for help in time of need", "Hebrews 4:16", "Let’s therefore draw near with boldness to the throne of grace, that we may receive mercy and may find grace for help in time of need.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-hebrews-13-5", "hebrews-13-5", "I will in no way leave you", "Hebrews 13:5", "Be free from the love of money, content with such things as you have, for he has said, “I will in no way leave you, neither will I in any way forsake you.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-genesis-28-15", "genesis-28-15", "I am with you", "Genesis 28:15", "Behold, I am with you, and will keep you, wherever you go, and will bring you again into this land. For I will not leave you until I have done that which I have spoken of to you.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-34-4", "psalm-34-4", "Delivered me from all my fears", "Psalm 34:4", "I sought the LORD, and he answered me, and delivered me from all my fears.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-94-19", "psalm-94-19", "Your comforts delight my soul", "Psalm 94:19", "In the multitude of my thoughts within me, your comforts delight my soul.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-isaiah-43-2", "isaiah-43-2", "I will be with you", "Isaiah 43:2", "When you pass through the waters, I will be with you, and through the rivers, they will not overflow you. When you walk through the fire, you will not be burned, and flame will not scorch you.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-isaiah-54-10", "isaiah-54-10", "My loving kindness will not depart from you", "Isaiah 54:10", "For the mountains may depart, and the hills be removed, but my loving kindness will not depart from you, and my covenant of peace will not be removed,” says the LORD who has mercy on you.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-103-12", "psalm-103-12", "So far has he removed our transgressions", "Psalm 103:12", "As far as the east is from the west, so far has he removed our transgressions from us.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-121-7", "psalm-121-7", "He will keep your soul", "Psalm 121:7", "The LORD will keep you from all evil. He will keep your soul.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-145-18", "psalm-145-18", "The LORD is near", "Psalm 145:18", "The LORD is near to all those who call on him, to all who call on him in truth.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalm-147-3", "psalm-147-3", "He heals the broken in heart", "Psalm 147:3", "He heals the broken in heart, and binds up their wounds.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-1-peter-2-24", "1-peter-2-24", "You were healed by his wounds", "1 Peter 2:24", "He himself bore our sins in his body on the tree, that we, having died to sins, might live to righteousness. You were healed by his wounds.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalms-36-7", "psalms-36-7", "The shadow of your wings", "Psalms 36:7", "How precious is your loving kindness, God! The children of men take refuge under the shadow of your wings.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalms-40-11", "psalms-40-11", "Your tender mercies", "Psalms 40:11", "Don’t withhold your tender mercies from me, LORD. Let your loving kindness and your truth continually preserve me.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalms-116-6", "psalms-116-6", "He saved me", "Psalms 116:6", "The LORD preserves the simple. I was brought low, and he saved me.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalms-119-52", "psalms-119-52", "Comforted myself", "Psalms 119:52", "I remember your ordinances of old, LORD, and have comforted myself.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalms-10-14", "psalms-10-14", "You help the victim and the fatherless", "Psalms 10:14", "But you do see trouble and grief. You consider it to take it into your hand. You help the victim and the fatherless.", "comfort"),
    VerseArtwork("comfort-psalms-41-3", "psalms-41-3", "The LORD will sustain him", "Psalms 41:3", "The LORD will sustain him on his sickbed, and restore him from his bed of illness.", "comfort"),
